        "valueString": "Denies shortness of breath at rest, orthopnoea, paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea, wheeze, chest tightness, stridor, and haemoptysis. Able to speak in full sentences; voice strong, no audible breathlessness or respiratory distress during conversation. No audible wheeze or stridor; occasional short coughing paroxysms."
