        },
        "valueString": "Denies pleuritic chest pain, chest pain, palpitations, syncope, confusion, focal neurological symptoms, seizures, severe headache, cyanosis, unilateral leg swelling, vomiting, diarrhoea, abdominal pain, dysuria, and otalgia. No home oxygen saturation readings of 94% or lower."
